| **Global State** | App-wide, complex            | NgRx, Akita, Elf      |
| **Server State** | Remote data, caching         | NgRx Query, RxAngular |
| **URL State**    | Route parameters             | ActivatedRoute        |
| **Form State**   | Input values, validation     | Reactive Forms        |

